<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Crookes raises half-yr headline shr, div.</title>
<headline>Crookes raises half-yr headline shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		   63.1	   vs     105.8</p>
<p>    - headline		 63.1	   vs	49.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  13.0	   vs	10.0</p>
<p>    Headline earnings	7.57	   vs	5.89</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   11.15	   vs	8.54</p>
<p>    Tax			  3.58	   vs	2.66</p>
<p>    Interest received	1.75	   vs	0.35</p>
<p>    Turnover		  42.15	   vs     34.61</p>
<p>Div payable January 15, 1997</p>
<p>on register December 13</p>
<p>Full name: Crookes Brothers Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
